        "name": "USN-9100-1",
        "description": "Marcus Brinkmann discovered that during decryption or verification, GnuPG did not properly filter out terminal sequences when reporting the original filename. An attacker could possibly use this issue to cause an application parsing GnuPG output to incorrectly interpret the status of the cryptographic operation reported by GnuPG.",
